note Rotation decode citations, independent of all OM-2 compiler sources:
note ARM DDI0487M.d C6.2.160 (p2201): EXTR sf|00|100111|N|0|Rm|imms|Rn|Rd, N=sf; ROR immediate Rn=Rm.
note C6.2.349 (p2580): RORV sf|00|11010110|Rm|001011|Rn|Rd (DP2 opcode 11).
